{"lang":"zh-CN","summary":"Navigation: 工程实践MOC | 面试总览","html":"<pre class=\"frontmatter language-yaml\" style=\"display: none; overflow-x: hidden !important; padding: 6px 12px 8px !important;\"><code class=\"language-yaml is-loaded\" style=\"display: block !important; width: 100% !important; min-width: 0px !important; overflow-x: auto !important; white-space: pre !important; overflow-wrap: normal !important; max-width: 100% !important; box-sizing: border-box !important; padding: 4px 0px 2px !important;\"><span class=\"token key atrule\">title</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"如何设计 Agent 的全链路可观测体系？\"</span>\n<span class=\"token key atrule\">type</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> interview\n<span class=\"token key atrule\">topic</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"工程实践\"</span>\n<span class=\"token key atrule\">difficulty</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> intermediate\n<span class=\"token key atrule\">importance</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> high\n<span class=\"token key atrule\">tags</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n  <span class=\"token punctuation\">-</span> agent/工程实践\n  <span class=\"token punctuation\">-</span> type/interview\n  <span class=\"token punctuation\">-</span> diff/intermediate</code><button class=\"copy-code-button\" aria-label=\"复制代码\" title=\"复制代码\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"svg-icon lucide-copy\"><rect x=\"8\" y=\"8\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M4 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2\"></path></svg></button></pre>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>Navigation</strong>: <a data-href=\"%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95/%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/00-Meta/MOCs/%E5%B7%A5%E7%A8%8B%E5%AE%9E%E8%B7%B5MOC/\" href=\"/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95/%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/00-Meta/MOCs/%E5%B7%A5%E7%A8%8B%E5%AE%9E%E8%B7%B5MOC/\" class=\"internal-link\" target=\"\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\">工程实践MOC</a> | <a data-href=\"面试总览\" href=\"面试总览\" class=\"internal-link\" target=\"\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\">面试总览</a></p>\n<h1 data-heading=\"如何设计 Agent 的全链路可观测体系？\" dir=\"auto\">如何设计 Agent 的全链路可观测体系？</h1>\n<h2 data-heading=\"问题\" dir=\"auto\">问题</h2>\n<p dir=\"auto\">生产环境的 Agent 系统需要监控哪些指标？如何设计全链路可观测体系？</p>\n<h4 data-heading=\"答案\" dir=\"auto\">答案</h4>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>一、Agent 可观测的三大支柱</strong></p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>支柱</th>\n<th>工具示例</th>\n<th>Agent 专项内容</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>Trace</strong> (链路追踪)</td>\n<td>OpenTelemetry, LangSmith, Langfuse</td>\n<td>完整请求链路：意图识别 → RAG检索 → LLM调用 → 工具执行 → 答案生成</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>Metrics</strong> (指标监控)</td>\n<td>Prometheus + Grafana</td>\n<td>TTFT, TBT, Token消耗, 幻觉率, 工具调用成功率</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>Logs</strong> (日志)</td>\n<td>ELK/Loki</td>\n<td>结构化日志：trace_id, model, token_count, latency, cost</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>二、Agent 专项指标体系</strong></p>\n<pre class=\"language-python\" style=\"overflow-x: hidden !important; padding: 6px 12px 8px !important;\"><code class=\"language-python is-loaded\" style=\"display: block !important; width: 100% !important; min-width: 0px !important; overflow-x: auto !important; white-space: pre !important; overflow-wrap: normal !important; max-width: 100% !important; box-sizing: border-box !important; padding: 4px 0px 2px !important;\"><span class=\"token comment\"># Agent 核心监控指标定义</span>\nAGENT_METRICS <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\n    <span class=\"token comment\"># === 延迟指标 ===</span>\n    <span class=\"token string\">\"ttft_p50\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"首字延迟 P50 (ms)\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>           <span class=\"token comment\"># 目标 &lt; 500ms</span>\n    <span class=\"token string\">\"ttft_p99\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"首字延迟 P99 (ms)\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>           <span class=\"token comment\"># 目标 &lt; 2000ms</span>\n    <span class=\"token string\">\"tbt_avg\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"Token 间平均延迟 (ms)\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>         <span class=\"token comment\"># 目标 &lt; 50ms</span>\n    <span class=\"token string\">\"e2e_latency_p50\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"端到端延迟 P50 (ms)\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>  <span class=\"token comment\"># 目标 &lt; 3000ms</span>\n    \n    <span class=\"token comment\"># === 成本指标 ===</span>\n    <span class=\"token string\">\"token_input_per_req\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"每请求 Input Token\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n    <span class=\"token string\">\"token_output_per_req\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"每请求 Output Token\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> \n    <span class=\"token string\">\"cost_per_req_usd\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"每请求成本 (USD)\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n    <span class=\"token string\">\"daily_cost_usd\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"日总成本 (USD)\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n    \n    <span class=\"token comment\"># === 质量指标 ===</span>\n    <span class=\"token string\">\"hallucination_rate\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"幻觉率 (%)\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>         <span class=\"token comment\"># 目标 &lt; 2%</span>\n    <span class=\"token string\">\"tool_call_success_rate\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"工具调用成功率 (%)\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>  <span class=\"token comment\"># 目标 &gt; 99%</span>\n    <span class=\"token string\">\"intent_accuracy\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"意图识别准确率 (%)\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>    <span class=\"token comment\"># 目标 &gt; 95%</span>\n    <span class=\"token string\">\"user_satisfaction\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"用户满意度 (CSAT)\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>   <span class=\"token comment\"># 目标 &gt; 4.2/5</span>\n    \n    <span class=\"token comment\"># === 系统指标 ===</span>\n    <span class=\"token string\">\"request_qps\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"每秒请求数\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n    <span class=\"token string\">\"error_rate\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"错误率 (%)\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>                 <span class=\"token comment\"># 目标 &lt; 0.5%</span>\n    <span class=\"token string\">\"cache_hit_rate\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"缓存命中率 (%)\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>         <span class=\"token comment\"># 目标 &gt; 30%</span>\n    <span class=\"token string\">\"model_degrade_rate\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"模型降级率 (%)\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>     <span class=\"token comment\"># 目标 &lt; 5%</span>\n<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span>\n</code><button class=\"copy-code-button\" aria-label=\"复制代码\" title=\"复制代码\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"svg-icon lucide-copy\"><rect x=\"8\" y=\"8\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M4 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2\"></path></svg></button></pre>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>三、LangSmith/Langfuse 等工具的核心能力</strong></p>\n<pre class=\"language-python\" style=\"overflow-x: hidden !important; padding: 6px 12px 8px !important;\"><code class=\"language-python is-loaded\" style=\"display: block !important; width: 100% !important; min-width: 0px !important; overflow-x: auto !important; white-space: pre !important; overflow-wrap: normal !important; max-width: 100% !important; box-sizing: border-box !important; padding: 4px 0px 2px !important;\"><span class=\"token comment\"># LangSmith 追踪示例</span>\n<span class=\"token keyword\">from</span> langsmith <span class=\"token keyword\">import</span> traceable\n<span class=\"token keyword\">from</span> langchain_openai <span class=\"token keyword\">import</span> ChatOpenAI\n\n<span class=\"token decorator annotation punctuation\">@traceable</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>run_type<span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token string\">\"llm\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>  <span class=\"token comment\"># 自动追踪 LLM 调用</span>\n<span class=\"token keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"token function\">agent_step</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>query<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">str</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> context<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">dict</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token operator\">-</span><span class=\"token operator\">&gt;</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">str</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n    llm <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> ChatOpenAI<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>model<span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token string\">\"gpt-4o\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n    <span class=\"token comment\"># 每个步骤自动记录：输入、输出、token消耗、延迟</span>\n    response <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> llm<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>invoke<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token string-interpolation\"><span class=\"token string\">f\"基于上下文 </span><span class=\"token interpolation\"><span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>context<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span></span><span class=\"token string\"> 回答：</span><span class=\"token interpolation\"><span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>query<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span></span><span class=\"token string\">\"</span></span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n    <span class=\"token keyword\">return</span> response<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>content\n\n<span class=\"token comment\"># 追踪结果包含：</span>\n<span class=\"token comment\"># - 完整调用链（Trace Tree）</span>\n<span class=\"token comment\"># - 每个节点的 Input/Output</span>\n<span class=\"token comment\"># - Token 使用量</span>\n<span class=\"token comment\"># - 延迟分解</span>\n<span class=\"token comment\"># - 模型名称和参数</span>\n</code><button class=\"copy-code-button\" aria-label=\"复制代码\" title=\"复制代码\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"svg-icon lucide-copy\"><rect x=\"8\" y=\"8\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M4 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2\"></path></svg></button></pre>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>四、AI 特有的漂移检测</strong></p>\n<pre class=\"language-python\" style=\"overflow-x: hidden !important; padding: 6px 12px 8px !important;\"><code class=\"language-python is-loaded\" style=\"display: block !important; width: 100% !important; min-width: 0px !important; overflow-x: auto !important; white-space: pre !important; overflow-wrap: normal !important; max-width: 100% !important; box-sizing: border-box !important; padding: 4px 0px 2px !important;\"><span class=\"token comment\"># Golden Set 持续评估</span>\n<span class=\"token keyword\">class</span> <span class=\"token class-name\">DriftDetector</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n    <span class=\"token keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"token function\">__init__</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>self<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> golden_set<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">list</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span>EvalCase<span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n        self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>golden_set <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> golden_set  <span class=\"token comment\"># 标准测试集（100-500条）</span>\n        self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>baseline_score <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>_evaluate<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n    \n    <span class=\"token keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"token function\">daily_check</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>self<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token operator\">-</span><span class=\"token operator\">&gt;</span> Alert <span class=\"token operator\">|</span> <span class=\"token boolean\">None</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n        current_score <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>_evaluate<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n        \n        <span class=\"token comment\"># 答案质量分数下降 &gt; 5% 触发告警</span>\n        <span class=\"token keyword\">if</span> self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>baseline_score <span class=\"token operator\">-</span> current_score <span class=\"token operator\">&gt;</span> <span class=\"token number\">0.05</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n            <span class=\"token keyword\">return</span> Alert<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>\n                level<span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token string\">\"P1\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n                message<span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token string-interpolation\"><span class=\"token string\">f\"质量漂移 detected: </span><span class=\"token interpolation\"><span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>baseline_score<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span><span class=\"token format-spec\">.3f</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span></span><span class=\"token string\"> -&gt; </span><span class=\"token interpolation\"><span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>current_score<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span><span class=\"token format-spec\">.3f</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span></span><span class=\"token string\">\"</span></span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n                possible_causes<span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span>\n                    <span class=\"token string\">\"知识库文档过期\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n                    <span class=\"token string\">\"模型版本切换\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n                    <span class=\"token string\">\"Prompt 被错误修改\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n                    <span class=\"token string\">\"工具 API 返回格式变化\"</span>\n                <span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span>\n            <span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n        <span class=\"token keyword\">return</span> <span class=\"token boolean\">None</span>\n</code><button class=\"copy-code-button\" aria-label=\"复制代码\" title=\"复制代码\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"svg-icon lucide-copy\"><rect x=\"8\" y=\"8\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M4 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2\"></path></svg></button></pre>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>五、告警分级体系</strong></p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>级别</th>\n<th>触发条件</th>\n<th>响应时间</th>\n<th>处理方案</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>P0</td>\n<td>模型全量不可用、消息丢失</td>\n<td>5 分钟</td>\n<td>自动降级 + 人工介入</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>P1</td>\n<td>错误率 &gt; 5%、TTFT &gt; 5s</td>\n<td>30 分钟</td>\n<td>熔断 + 扩容</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>P2</td>\n<td>准确率下降、成本异常</td>\n<td>次日处理</td>\n<td>分析 + 优化</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<h4 data-heading=\"延伸追问\" dir=\"auto\">延伸追问</h4>\n<ul>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>\"你提到 LangSmith，能具体说说怎么落地的吗？\"</strong>\n<ul>\n<li dir=\"auto\">在所有 LLM 调用处添加 <code class=\"code-styler-inline\">@traceable</code> 装饰器</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\">定义统一的 Tag 体系：project, environment, model_version</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\">设置每日 Golden Set 自动评估 Pipeline</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\">集成 Slack/PagerDuty 告警</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h4 data-heading=\"常见误区\" dir=\"auto\">常见误区</h4>\n<ul>\n<li dir=\"auto\">❌ \"只监控系统指标就够了\" — Agent 需要专门的业务指标（幻觉率、满意度）</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\">❌ \"等用户投诉再发现问题\" — 需要主动的质量漂移检测</li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<hr>\n<h2 data-heading=\"相关知识点\" dir=\"auto\">相关知识点</h2>\n<ul>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><a data-href=\"%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95/%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/00-Meta/MOCs/%E5%B7%A5%E7%A8%8B%E5%AE%9E%E8%B7%B5MOC/\" href=\"/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95/%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/00-Meta/MOCs/%E5%B7%A5%E7%A8%8B%E5%AE%9E%E8%B7%B5MOC/\" class=\"internal-link\" target=\"\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\">工程实践MOC</a></li>\n</ul>","headings":[]}